"""Generate a self-contained HTML sprite index for the PORTHOLE design brief.

Renders every sprite and tile at 2:1 pixel aspect ratio (matching BBC Micro
MODE 2/5 hardware), embeds them as base64 PNGs, and produces a single HTML
file a designer can open in any browser.

Usage:
  ./tools/gen-sprite-index --out docs/sprite_index.html
"""

